@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

title NDP: Router Solicitation / Advertisement

participant "Host nou\nfe80::A" as H
participant "Rețea locală" as N
participant "Router\nfe80::1" as R

H -> N : RS (opțional)\nmulticast all-routers ff02::2\n"Există vreun router pe link?"

note right of R
  Routerul trimite RA periodic
  indiferent de RS
end note

R -> N : RA (multicast all-nodes ff02::1)\nprefix: 2001:db8:1::/64\nMTU, hop limit, flag M/O, lifetime

note right of H
  Host reține:
  - default gateway: fe80::1
  - prefix pentru SLAAC: 2001:db8:1::/64
end note
@enduml